+# Feature Specification: Long-stay discount
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-11 | **Status**: Implemented
+
+## User Scenarios & Testing
+
+### User Story 1 - Cheaper long rentals (P1)
+A rental of 3 or more days costs 10% less than full price (days × daily price). Quotes and bookings show the reduced total.
+**Acceptance**:
+1. Given a 3-day rental at 2500/day, quote and booking total are 6750 (not 7500).
+2. Given a 2-day rental, the total is the full price.
+3. Longer rentals (e.g. 7 days) are discounted the same 10%.
+
+### Edge cases
+- Reduced total is a whole number of cents, rounded half up (e.g. 3 × 2505 = 7515 → 6763.5 → 6764).
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: If days >= 3, total = round(days × dailyPrice × 0.9) computed in integer arithmetic; otherwise days × dailyPrice.
+- **FR-002**: `quote` and `book` use the same computation.
+
+## Assumptions
+- Constitution is an unfilled template; no extra rules apply.
+- Discount is a flat 10% on the whole rental, not only on days beyond the third.
